event: thinking
data: {"id": "45ad8ecdf64e49b0-thinking-parallel_evidence-642", "run_id": "45ad8ecdf64e49b0", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据采集到的真实工具结果，诊断结论如下：\n\n### 1. 已确认事实（证据支持）\n* **直接根因已明确**：Pod 状态持续为 `Pending`（`ContainerCreating`），`kubectl describe` 返回的关键事件明确指出 `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found`。这直接指向 **ConfigMap 缺失导致的挂载失败**。\n* **Spec 配置验证**：YAML Spec 中 `volumes` 定义了 `input`，并引用了 `configMap: unavailable-config`，与事件中的错误信息完全一致。\n* **等待状态持续**：Prometheus 指标 `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` 显示 `reason=\"ContainerCreating\"` 且值为 1，确认异常仍在持续。Pod 尚未分配 IP，因此日志和 Trace 为空/无数据是预期结", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789049789040, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "45ad8ecdf64e49b0-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "45ad8ecdf64e49b0", "seq": 643, "ts_ms": 1789049797617, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 34.799, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-03", "name": "workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/45ad8ecdf64e49b0-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "4c9d6b0234faceecd6ee6b7cda74e836661a9bb69c8453f78b7665fac94f8732", "bytes": 2452}, "snapshot_sha256": "fe62b5c14efc212c0c3451f70d0ac5f1e34b78bd73f30fbf3650e804a65e887a"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "45ad8ecdf64e49b0-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "45ad8ecdf64e49b0", "seq": 644, "ts_ms": 1789049797618, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "45ad8ecdf64e49b0-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "45ad8ecdf64e49b0", "seq": 645, "ts_ms": 1789049806711, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 9.093, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1702, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974 stuck in ContainerCreating/Pending state due to volume mount failure |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `FailedMount: MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` [fact-5baa839566b4] | 直接确认 Volume 'input' 因依赖的 ConfigMap 缺失而无法挂载，导致初始化阻塞 |\n| 2 | K8s Config | kubernetes | `container.resource_request.memory`: 8Mi; `container.resource_limit.memory`: 32Mi [fact-4e3b3f8d0083, fact-d9405595688c] | 排除资源配额不足，资源请求与限制均在极低位 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `pod.phase`: Pending; `pod.condition.Ready`: False [fact-aeef495978a8, fact-bc5c391b8b3e] | 确证 Pod 处于未就绪阻塞状态，且未触发重启 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` (reason: ContainerCreating) 值为 1 [fact-c9a636fcf6ed] | 验证容器卡在启动前的等待阶段，未进入 Running 或 Error 状态 |\n\n**证据印证关系：**\nKubernetes Event 明确指出挂载失败的具体原因是缺少 ConfigMap `unavailable-config`，Metric 状态与 K8s Pod Phase (Pending) 互相印证，说明 Pod 卡在初始化阶段无法进一步执行，且未因 OOM 或其他资源问题（如事实 2 所示的极低资源限额）导致启动失败。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap 'unavailable-config' 不存在 → Kubelet 挂载 Volume 'input' 失败 → Pod 阻塞在 Pending/ContainerCreating 状态 → 容器未启动，业务现象表现为服务不可用\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因**：Pod `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974` 声明的 Volume `input` 依赖 ConfigMap `unavailable-config`，该 ConfigMap 在命名空间 `aiops-case-03` 中不存在（见事实 #1）。这导致 Kubelet 初始化阶段无法完成挂载，Pod 进入 Pending 状态且容器始终处于 ContainerCreating 阶段 [fact-5baa839566b4, fact-c9a636fcf6ed]。\n\n**未确认事项**：ConfigMap `unavailable-config` 缺失的具体原因（如拼写错误、定义未提交或被意外删除）。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974 stuck in ContainerCreating/Pending state due to volume mount failure |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `FailedMount: MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` [fact-5baa839566b4] | 直接确认 Volume 'input' 因依赖的 ConfigMap 缺失而无法挂载，导致初始化阻塞 |\n| 2 | K8s Config | kubernetes | `container.resource_request.memory`: 8Mi; `container.resource_limit.memory`: 32Mi [fact-4e3b3f8d0083, fact-d9405595688c] | 排除资源配额不足，资源请求与限制均在极低位 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `pod.phase`: Pending; `pod.condition.Ready`: False [fact-aeef495978a8, fact-bc5c391b8b3e] | 确证 Pod 处于未就绪阻塞状态，且未触发重启 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` (reason: ContainerCreating) 值为 1 [fact-c9a636fcf6ed] | 验证容器卡在启动前的等待阶段，未进入 Running 或 Error 状态 |\n\n**证据印证关系：**\nKubernetes Event 明确指出挂载失败的具体原因是缺少 ConfigMap `unavailable-config`，Metric 状态与 K8s Pod Phase (Pending) 互相印证，说明 Pod 卡在初始化阶段无法进一步执行，且未因 OOM 或其他资源问题（如事实 2 所示的极低资源限额）导致启动失败。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap 'unavailable-config' 不存在 → Kubelet 挂载 Volume 'input' 失败 → Pod 阻塞在 Pending/ContainerCreating 状态 → 容器未启动，业务现象表现为服务不可用\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因**：Pod `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974` 声明的 Volume `input` 依赖 ConfigMap `unavailable-config`，该 ConfigMap 在命名空间 `aiops-case-03` 中不存在（见事实 #1）。这导致 Kubelet 初始化阶段无法完成挂载，Pod 进入 Pending 状态且容器始终处于 ContainerCreating 阶段 [fact-5baa839566b4, fact-c9a636fcf6ed]。\n\n**未确认事项**：ConfigMap `unavailable-config` 缺失的具体原因（如拼写错误、定义未提交或被意外删除）。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

