data: {"id": "45ad8ecdf64e49b0-final", "run_id": "45ad8ecdf64e49b0", "seq": 647, "ts_ms": 1789049806721, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974 stuck in ContainerCreating/Pending state due to volume mount failure |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `FailedMount: MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` [fact-5baa839566b4] | 直接确认 Volume 'input' 因依赖的 ConfigMap 缺失而无法挂载，导致初始化阻塞 |\n| 2 | K8s Config | kubernetes | `container.resource_request.memory`: 8Mi; `container.resource_limit.memory`: 32Mi [fact-4e3b3f8d0083, fact-d9405595688c] | 排除资源配额不足，资源请求与限制均在极低位 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `pod.phase`: Pending; `pod.condition.Ready`: False [fact-aeef495978a8, fact-bc5c391b8b3e] | 确证 Pod 处于未就绪阻塞状态，且未触发重启 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` (reason: ContainerCreating) 值为 1 [fact-c9a636fcf6ed] | 验证容器卡在启动前的等待阶段，未进入 Running 或 Error 状态 |\n\n**证据印证关系：**\nKubernetes Event 明确指出挂载失败的具体原因是缺少 ConfigMap `unavailable-config`，Metric 状态与 K8s Pod Phase (Pending) 互相印证，说明 Pod 卡在初始化阶段无法进一步执行，且未因 OOM 或其他资源问题（如事实 2 所示的极低资源限额）导致启动失败。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap 'unavailable-config' 不存在 → Kubelet 挂载 Volume 'input' 失败 → Pod 阻塞在 Pending/ContainerCreating 状态 → 容器未启动，业务现象表现为服务不可用\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因**：Pod `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974` 声明的 Volume `input` 依赖 ConfigMap `unavailable-config`，该 ConfigMap 在命名空间 `aiops-case-03` 中不存在（见事实 #1）。这导致 Kubelet 初始化阶段无法完成挂载，Pod 进入 Pending 状态且容器始终处于 ContainerCreating 阶段 [fact-5baa839566b4, fact-c9a636fcf6ed]。\n\n**未确认事项**：ConfigMap `unavailable-config` 缺失的具体原因（如拼写错误、定义未提交或被意外删除）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.2m\n├─ 问题定位: 25.6s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 34.8s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974: 34.8s (Evidence 26.3s, RCA 8.4s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.1s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974**: pod-volume-mount-failed, pod-imagepull-failed, pod-sandbox-create-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 69.51, "metrics": {"run_id": "45ad8ecdf64e49b0", "mttr": {"value": "1.2m", "seconds": 69.51604270935059, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed, pod-sandbox-create-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 69516.04270935059, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 66108.4578037262, "tool_calls": 17, "executed_tool_calls": 11, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 5, "successful_tool_calls